{"3891080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "P-PAN", "steam_appid": 3891080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4895260], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/f4eda11bb2de1d2ea4a7eeb29235b774.avif?t=1785424732\" width=383 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P-PAN is a simple, pick-up-and-play 2D action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling off platforms? No worries, you can fly anytime you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch enemies, collect loot, and unleash special moves whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your rhythm and push onward!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-STORY-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P-PAN lives peacefully on Panchu Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, a mysterious giant robot suddenly appears and steals everything from P-PAN's home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nothing left to lose, P-PAN sets out on an adventure to restore their home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/066266e81076e0dbc3dd350f0da55f6d.avif?t=1785424732\" width=384 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P-PAN's special skill is a bright smile, oh, and punches that fly endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether walking or soaring through the air, fire off rapid punches and have a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- The hot invincible item, &quot;Spicy Cheese&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/b124339f1a950b1dd0a0258534e78a3d.avif?t=1785424732\" alt=\"Spicy Cheese (orange cheese cut into triangles and garnished with chili peppers)\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting this item will make you invincible for a certain period of time and allow you to unleash a fiery punch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It appears frequently throughout the stage, so use it as much as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Collect &quot;P Points&quot; from enemies to unleash two awesome Special Moves!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/68f2059e29ae6be3a56cf0d01c2cdd83.avif?t=1785424732\" alt=\"P-Pan fires his special move &amp;quot;P Cannon&amp;quot; straight from both hands.\" width=384 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The P Crash and P Cannon can both wipe out tons of enemies at once - perfect for getting out of tight spots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Defeat bosses within the target time to earn prizes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/a776ac36c0faa015719508179cace428.avif?t=1785424732\" alt=\"Prize (white box with red ribbon)\" width=115 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open these prize boxes to build up the Collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect them all and restore P-PAN's home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Colorful pixel-art maps, original music, and a variety of stages to enjoy even in short bursts!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 stages in total + 1 bonus stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage and boss has its own unique music, with boss battles really cranking up the excitement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now go punch your way to 100% completion!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/f4eda11bb2de1d2ea4a7eeb29235b774.avif?t=1785424732\" width=383 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P-PAN is a simple, pick-up-and-play 2D action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling off platforms? No worries, you can fly anytime you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch enemies, collect loot, and unleash special moves whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your rhythm and push onward!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-STORY-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P-PAN lives peacefully on Panchu Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, a mysterious giant robot suddenly appears and steals everything from P-PAN's home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nothing left to lose, P-PAN sets out on an adventure to restore their home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>***</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/066266e81076e0dbc3dd350f0da55f6d.avif?t=1785424732\" width=384 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >P-PAN's special skill is a bright smile, oh, and punches that fly endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether walking or soaring through the air, fire off rapid punches and have a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- The hot invincible item, &quot;Spicy Cheese&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/b124339f1a950b1dd0a0258534e78a3d.avif?t=1785424732\" alt=\"Spicy Cheese (orange cheese cut into triangles and garnished with chili peppers)\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting this item will make you invincible for a certain period of time and allow you to unleash a fiery punch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It appears frequently throughout the stage, so use it as much as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Collect &quot;P Points&quot; from enemies to unleash two awesome Special Moves!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/68f2059e29ae6be3a56cf0d01c2cdd83.avif?t=1785424732\" alt=\"P-Pan fires his special move &amp;quot;P Cannon&amp;quot; straight from both hands.\" width=384 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The P Crash and P Cannon can both wipe out tons of enemies at once - perfect for getting out of tight spots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Defeat bosses within the target time to earn prizes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/extras/a776ac36c0faa015719508179cace428.avif?t=1785424732\" alt=\"Prize (white box with red ribbon)\" width=115 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open these prize boxes to build up the Collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect them all and restore P-PAN's home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Colorful pixel-art maps, original music, and a variety of stages to enjoy even in short bursts!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 stages in total + 1 bonus stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage and boss has its own unique music, with boss battles really cranking up the excitement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now go punch your way to 100% completion!</p>", "short_description": "With a cheerful smile and endless punches, blast your way forward! A 2D action game that's easy for anyone to enjoy!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/b691013d5aba199c2da5763326421546ac5ff154/header.jpg?t=1785424732", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/6c99d43aeb0b33c24065db0402e30889d20353c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785424732", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891080/6c99d43aeb0b33c24065db0402e30889d20353c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785424732", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10(64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2450M  2.50GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 3000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10(64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700 3.60GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"